  The .7 voice update adds lazy installed-voice discovery, named persistent
  profiles, gender/culture selection, requested pitch, Windows rate, volume,
  unsaved preview/stop and inactive deletion. Host speech snapshots apply to
  progress, replies and completion. A separate cancellable provider contract
  prepares for mandatory future arbitrary identity/timbre/emotional style;
  that engine and its richer controls are not implemented or downloaded.
  Profile updates are serialized/atomic/bounded and errors are visible.
  Native PCM checks verify actual selection/rate/pitch/volume without playback;
  requested pitch is approximate, not a calibrated semitone promise.
